## Frontmatter

Each page starts with frontmatter. `title` is the page title. `order` sorts
the page in its sidebar group. `sidebarGroup` names the group.

## Components

<docs.Steps>
1. Add the component to the `Components` list in `site/site.go`.
2. Use the tag in a Markdown file.
3. Run `go run ./cmd/gx check`.
</docs.Steps>

## Links

A link to another page is a site path: [Get started](/start/). The check
fails on a link to a page or a heading that does not exist.
